In this section, we illustrate the generated dataset based on the method presented in~\ref{fig:bo_nobank}. 
The degree distribution, see Section~\ref{app:account_relations}, is generated using $\gamma=2.0$, $\mathrm{loc} = 1.0$, and $\mathrm{scale}=1.0$.
