\textbf{RQ$_1$}: 
A modified version of the Chain of Density (CoD) prompt that includes a definition of an entity tailored to the context of mobile app reviews significantly improves the semantic density and entity recall of review summaries, outperforming the original CoD prompt, a vanilla prompt, and Hybrid TF-IDF.				
\end{tcolorbox}


