\section{Conclusion and Future Work}
\label{sec:conclusion}

In this study, we introduced \MEdGellan, an efficient framework for hybrid medical decision-making that requires no finetuning or annotations.
%
Our preliminary experiments demonstrate how ``guidance'' obtained with \MEdGellan can enhance the quality of predicted diagnoses over the sole usage of raw inputs, including triage information or radiology reports.
%
In future work, we plan to investigate the impact of guidance when presented to human physicians and to extend \MEdGellan to utilize rich non-textual information, such as the radiology images themselves, along with text data.


