Let $\xi_{n,m}^{t}=q_{n,m}^{t} \rho_{n,m}^{t}$ indicate whether the measurement of robot $n$ is received by robot $m$ in slot $t$. $q_{n,m}^t=1$ if robot $n$ transmits to robot $m$, and $q_{n,m}^t=0$, otherwise. $\rho_{n,m}^{t}=1$, if the transmission is successful, and $\rho_{n,m}^{t}=0$, otherwise. As a result, $\xi_{n,m}^{t}=1$, if the measurement of robot $n$ is received by robot $m$ in slot $t$; otherwise, $\xi_{n,m}^{t}=0$. 

