The belief distribution of the estimation error $e_{n,m}^t$ has the following cases:
\begin{itemize}
    \item When $\xi_{n,m}^t=1$, the {operational status} $x_{n}^t$ is updated at slot $t$, i.e.,
    % \begin{subequations}
