\textbf{Algorithm \ref{algorithm}} summarizes the proposed semi-decentralized MADDPG, where the robots do not need to download samples for training their actors, and they can upload their local experiences with high rewards upon the request of the BS. This contributes to the reduced communication overhead and increased flexibility. Let $\beta_{\mathrm{o}}$, $\beta_{\mathrm{a}}$, and $\beta_{\mathrm{r}}$ denote the sizes of $o_m$, $a_m$, and $r_m$ ($\forall m \in \cal{M}$), 
