The proposed semi-decentralized MADDPG framework removes the need for each robot to transmit its observations instantaneously to the server. This avoids the potential air interface congestion that could arise in a centralized control approach, e.g., the centralized implementation of DDPG/MADDPG for collaborator selection and resource allocation.
