% \ziiinoodler (0.06\,s), \cvcv (0.12\,s), and \ostrich (13.08\,s).
% Moreover, \ziiinoodlerpos also has same lowest median as \ziiinoodler and \ziii (0.01\,s).
In \cref{fig:cactus}
we give a cactus plot comparing sorted running times on all benchmarks, showing 
the superior performance of \ziiinoodlerpos.

