    Let \( {\unlhd} \subseteq  \ksChoiceImage{\ksChoiceFunction} \times  \ksChoiceImage{\ksChoiceFunction} \) be the binary relation on \( \ksChoiceImage{\ksChoiceFunction} \) which is given by Definition~\ref{def:encoding_scheme}
