%In case of EVs, the departures times are associated with arrivals of EVs, and hence become conditional on arrival time. We assume that the probability distribution %for connected times ($t_{depart} - t_{Arrive}$) can be represented using GMMs. (Energy required can be modelled similar to the connected times.)

