    \field{abstract}{%
    Abstract This paper describes a new beam finite element formulation based
  upon the geometrically exact beam theory. In contrast to many previously
  proposed beam finite element formulations the present discretization approach
  retains the frame-indifference (or objectivity) of the underlying beam
  theory. The space interpolation of rotational degrees-of-freedom is
