    \item $\mathcal{A}$ is the action space,
    \item $\mathcal{P}_S \otimes \mathcal{P}_\omega$ with $\mathcal{P}_S: \mathcal{S} \times \mathcal{A} \times \mathcal{S} \xrightarrow{} [0,1]$  and $\mathcal{P}_\omega:\Omega\times\Omega\xrightarrow{}[0,1]$ are the transition functions over the state and preference spaces, respectively,
