In this part we show Theorems~\ref{intro:main_thm_adaptive},~\ref{intro:main_thm_oblivious} and~\ref{intro:main_cor_det}. The algorithm is in Section~\ref{subsec:algo}, the analysis in Section~\ref{subsec:analysis}. 

