In this work, we focus on musicology,  
a field where the impact of LLMs still needs to be explored.
Musicology, the scholarly study of music, spans from historical research to theoretical analysis~\cite{harap1937nature,groveMusicology}.
Our research mainly focuses on the former,
an area %of study 
