where $\mathcal{P}$ is in the form \eqref{matP}, with $(\alpha,\beta)=(\Delta t D_\phi, 1+w\Delta t)$, $(\alpha,\beta)=(\Delta t D_c,1)$, $(\alpha,\beta)=(2\Delta t D_\phi, 3+2w\Delta t)$, $(\alpha,\beta)=(2\Delta t D_c,3)$, respectively. 
