$(a) \Rightarrow (b)$: Suppose there exists a balanced payment vector $\mathbf{p}$ such that $(A, \mathbf{p})$ is SEF. That is, for all agents $i \in N$,
\begin{align} \label{eq:SEF-for-agent}
