\end{align*}
The difference between utilities $u(v)_1$ and $u(v')_1$ is:
\begin{align*}
& u(v)_1 - u(v')_1 = \\
&  \frac{v_1(a_2) - v_1(o_2) + 3v_1(a_1) + v_1(o_1) - \left( v_2(a_1) - v_2(o_1) - v_2(a_2) + v_2(o_2) \right)}{4} - \\
