If v'1(c1)+v1(c4)+v2(c2)+v2(c5) >= v1(c2)+v1(c5)+v2(c1)+v2(c4): 
    Matching    1-a1, 2-a2:
    p1 = (1/2)E1 - (1/2)E2
         E1 = v1(c5) - v1(c4)
         E2 = v2(c4) - v2(c5)
    p1 = [v'1(c5) + v2(c5) - v1(c4) - v2(c4)]/2
    u1 = v1(c1)+v1(c4) + [v1(c5) + v2(c5) - v1(c4) - v2(c4)]/2

Otherwise:  
    Matching    1-a2, 2-a1:
         E1 = v1(c1)+v1(c4)-v1(c2)  -  v1(c2)-v1(c5)+v1(c1)
         E1 = 2v'1(c1) - 2v1(c2) + v1(c4) - v1(c5)

         E2 = v2(c2)+v2(c5)-v2(c1) - v2(c1)-v2(c4)+v2(c2)
         E2 = 2v2(c2)   - 2v2(c1) + v2(c5)  - v2(c4)
         p1 = (E1-E2)/2
         p1 = (v1'(c1)- v1(c2) + v1(c4)/2 - v1(c5)/2 
             - v2(c2) + v2(c1) - v2(c5)/2 + v2(c4)/2)

         u1 = v1(c2)+v1(c5) + p1
     = v1(c5)/2 + v'1(c1) + v1(c4)/2 - v2(c2) + v2(c1) - v2(c5)/2 + v2(c4)/2

We need:
    v1(c5)/2 + v1(c1) + v1(c4)/2 - v2(c2) + v2(c1) - v2(c5)/2 + v2(c4)/2
    >
    v1(c1) + v1(c4) + v1(c5)/2 + v2(c5)/2 - v1(c4)/2 - v2(c4)/2

