In this model, each agent evaluates what is the fixed entitlement of every other agent. That is, the entitlement of agent $j\in N$, in agent $i\in N$ point of view is $w_{i,j} = \frac{v_i(o_j)}{\sum_{k\in N} v_i(o_k)} \geq 0$. 
