\section{Methodology} 
\vspace{-0.1em}
%In this work, we propose a novel complex-valued UNet based architecture, CFTT-Net, that enhances the audio quality in both magnitude and phase domain by leveraging the intrinsic properties of complex-valued signals. CFTT-Net has complex eight encoders, complex eight decoders, conformer in bottleneck, global time frequency attention module at first and seventh encoder, and complex skip connections.

