\subsection{Complex Decoder:}  
The decoder reconstructs the time-frequency representation from the latent space by employing a transposed complex convolution by upsampling by a factor of two at each decoder block. For a latent complex tensor 
\begin{align}
\mathbf{Z} = \mathbf{Z}_r + j\,\mathbf{Z}_i,
\end{align}
the transposed convolution is formulated as:
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
