\subsubsection{A Meeting Protocol for Two Adjacent Agents}

In this section, we propose a deterministic protocol that guarantees a meeting between two adjacent agents within $ O(\log \lambda) $ rounds. This protocol ensures that at least one of the agents moves to the other's location, enabling the agents to meet.


