\caption{Performance comparison of two model checkpoints.}
\label{table:2}
\end{table}

These metrics measure how close the generated captions are to the referenced captions created in Section 3. The metrics shown in Table 2 
suggests that MusiScene produces captions that are more context-related and capable of scene imagination than MU-LLaMA. 
% More specifically, MusiScene outperforms MU-LLaMA in generating captions that are not only more precise and semantically similar to the reference captions but also better aligned in terms of meaning and structure.

\paragraph{Text2Music Gen}  
For the objective evaluation of the text-to-music generation task, our results indicate that MSI captions generate relatively plausible music under both metrics. However, video captions and fusion captions can also produce plausible music. 

\begin{table}[htbp]
\centering
