Although a lower FAD indicates that the generated audio is closer to the actual audio in terms of distribution, this does not necessarily imply better quality. This is the case for video captions where it achieves the highest FAD score yet scored the lowest in KL Divergence and subjective evaluation.

\subsection{Subjective Evaluation}

Table 4 below shows the average scores of the 15 x 3 video-music evaluations by 68 respondents. Table 5 below shows the average scores of the 8 x 2 video-music evaluations by 50 respondents.


